    "sourceWikitext": "{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Salad recipes\n| Difficulty = 1\n}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of Cyprus|Cuisine of Cyprus]]\n\n'''Traditional salad''' ''(Χωριάτικη σαλάτα)'' is a salad that can be served together with most foods in Cyprus.\n\n==Ingredients==\n* 1 [[Cookbook:tomato|tomato]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:cucumber|cucumber]]\n* 3 leaves of [[Cookbook:lettuce|lettuce]]\n* 1 small [[Cookbook:onion|onion]]\n* 1 spoon of [[Cookbook:Feta Cheese|feta cheese]], cut into small pieces\n* 5–6 black [[Cookbook:olive|olives]]\n* 3 spoons of [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* 2 spoons of [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Cut the vegetables into pieces.\n# Put them in a bowl and decorate them with onions, feta cheese and olives. If you want you can decorate your bowl with every way!\n# Before serving, add salad and olive oil with lemon and shake.\n\n[[Category:Cypriot recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon juice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lettuce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using feta]]",
    "isRecipe": true,
